            "slot": "s931",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · “After the birth of my son, my hair star",
            "text": "<span class=\"pf-paragraph-content\">“After the birth of my son, my hair started to shed and get thin. “...” I had such a good result in a little more than 6 months. With good care of myself, and using the brush everyday this is what happened.”</span>",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
