          "settings": {
            "slot": "s940",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · \"I suffer from genetic hair loss, and af",
            "text": "<span class=\"pf-paragraph-content\">\"I suffer from genetic hair loss, and after a stressful year, I started to see almost bald patches. I managed to recover them pretty quickly in the first 3 months and after the 5th month, the regrowth started to be visible. I feel so much better and less judged when I go out.\"</span>",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
